{{ template "chart.header" . }}

This chart installs the namespace-scoped Vault Secrets Reloader. It authenticates to Vault using the operator ServiceAccount projected JWT (audience `vault`) and reads KV v2 metadata; Vault Secrets Webhook remains responsible for injecting secret values.

Teams opt in their namespace and set the following Pod-template annotations on each workload:

```yaml
secrets-reloader.security.bank-vaults.io/reload-on-secret-change: "true"
secrets-reloader.security.bank-vaults.io/vault-role: "reloader-metadata-role"
```

The named Vault role must permit the operator ServiceAccount and have metadata-only policies. Configure `namespaced.vaultAddressAllowlist` with the trusted Vault origins and install the CRD separately or set `namespaced.installCRD=true`. See `docs/namespaced-operator.md` in the source repository for setup and security details. Build and publish the corresponding operator image before installing this chart.

